            {
                "comment": "Hasan is a super cool guy.  Gives decent lectures but you have to be somewhat interested in genetics and new technology in this field in order to stay on top of things.  Assigns dense scientific articles to read for homework. Graded discussion group worksheets most class periods. Willing to work with you if you have to miss class!",
